        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86299, Geometric Rectangular Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 7 different sizes ranging from 4-1/4 inches to 13-1/4 inches long, the Geometric Rectangular Cabinet Pull is as versatile as it is stylish. This Rectangular Cabinet Pull is not just for the kitchen, it can be used as a pull on any lightweight door or drawer. Emtek's Geometric Rectangular Cabinet Knob is available in several modern finish color options. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/geometric-square-cabinet-knob-emtek-86295\"><b>Geometric Square Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Geometric Rectangular Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86299-specifications.pdf?v=1718159607\"><b>Emtek Geometric Rectangular Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 7 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>86299:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86300:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86301:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86492:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86302:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 7-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86303:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 11-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86493:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 13-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
